WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.396
Stuck? There is a guide.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:11.099
Stuck? Lifting Lab has a Help center. Short guides, one task each. Free to read, and written step by step.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:17.477
Use search. Type a word, like export. You land on the exact section.

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:22.577
Open a guide and follow the steps. Check the weight and reps. Tap Made or Miss.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:27.909
Then do it in the app. Log a set, and the rest timer starts.

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:31.943
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
